#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:2 f7bdfb14b2494264b56ca80c66acf51e
msgid "_`Metadata Configuration`"
msgstr "元数据配置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:5 86a77d9091e443cd853e4675c0041ae6
msgid "_`Project-level Settings`"
msgstr "项目级设置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:7 27c1d41e75334ca4abdc709bba17ea32
msgid ""
"metadata.json is the one place that defines food_volume_measure. It holds"
" the package identity plus every build, dependency and documentation "
"setting, so the CMake configuration, the Conan recipe and the "
"documentation pipeline all read the same values instead of repeating "
"them."
msgstr ""
"metadata.json 是 food_volume_measure 唯一的配置来源。包标识和构建、依赖、文档的全部设置都放在这里，CMake "
"配置、Conan 配方和文档流水线读的都是同一份值，不用各处重复。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:12 e61a4589cbc144c4b6dbd50b1e97ddfb
msgid "_`File Structure`"
msgstr "文件结构"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:14 7cf5c7d5528f460a8e7f5f166edc5e6b
msgid ""
"The JSON file is organized in sections: the package identity (name, "
"target, version, team, license, description, authors, maintainers, "
"topics, url and homepage), the build configuration (cmake_version, "
"build_cppstd, build_cstd, build_type, activate_code_coverage, is_shared, "
"is_header, generate_modules_inplace, std_modules and user_modules), the "
"dependencies object, baremetal_white_list, graphviz_bin, the "
"documentation settings (doc_languages, doc_versions, doc_doxygen_folders "
"and doc_doxygen_suffix), and the automation switches (trigger_tests, "
"saving_tests_log, enable_python_bindings and workflow_triggers)."
msgstr ""
"这个 JSON "
"文件按块组织：包标识（name、target、version、team、license、description、authors、maintainers、topics、url"
" 和 "
"homepage）、构建配置（cmake_version、build_cppstd、build_cstd、build_type、activate_code_coverage、is_shared、is_header、generate_modules_inplace、std_modules"
" 和 user_modules）、dependencies "
"对象、baremetal_white_list、graphviz_bin、文档设置（doc_languages、doc_versions、doc_doxygen_folders"
" 和 "
"doc_doxygen_suffix），以及自动化开关（trigger_tests、saving_tests_log、enable_python_bindings"
" 和 workflow_triggers）。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:23 fa97541fdf134269aa67d241c7d932d9
msgid "_`Key Settings`"
msgstr "关键设置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:25 2d3a0d4a041f4cd49ca66b8251b1a9da
msgid ""
"The build configuration sets the expected toolchain and the language "
"standards used for the library targets. The dependencies object is split "
"into four buckets (common, c, cpp and infra), and each entry maps a Conan"
" package name to the CMake targets that should be linked into the "
"matching library. baremetal_white_list names the packages that survive a "
"bare-metal cross build. The documentation settings decide which languages"
" and versions are generated and which folders and file suffixes Doxygen "
"scans."
msgstr ""
"构建配置确定期望的工具链和库目标使用的语言标准。dependencies 分成四个分桶（common、c、cpp、infra），每一项把一个 "
"Conan 包名映射到应该链接进对应库的 CMake 目标。baremetal_white_list "
"列出裸机交叉构建时保留的包。文档设置决定生成哪些语言和版本，以及 Doxygen 扫描哪些目录和文件后缀。"

